(Today we are publishing the Nextwave School Tech Readiness Index \(NTRI\) - a public,) Tj
T* (evidence-based measure of how ready schools in Kaduna State are to teach and use technology. It) Tj
T* (is built so that schools, funders, government and parents can finally see the reality on the ground,) Tj
T* (school by school, and act on it.) Tj
