(Northern Nigeria's tech education crisis is well documented - but documentation is not the same as) Tj
T* (measurement. Without a shared, comparable baseline, support becomes guesswork: computers) Tj
T* (are donated to schools that cannot power them, while schools with working labs are overlooked.) Tj
T* (The NTRI replaces guesswork with a consistent, inspectable score.) Tj
